    <div>This room is spacious</div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">母は頭が<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">痛いです</span></div>
    <div>haha wa atama ga itai desu</div>
    <div>mother [topic] head [subject] hurts</div>
    <div>My mother's head hurts</div>
    <div class="grammar-verbs-ideograms">彼は真面目です<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">が人</span>が/は<span class="grammar-verbs-highlight">優しいです</span></div>
    <div>kare wa majime desu ga hito ga/wa yasashii desu</div>
    <div>he [subject] serious is but person [subject] kind is</div>
    <div>He is serious, but a kind person</div>
</div>
